{"segment_id":85,"start":412.0,"end":420.0,"text":"这能怪我们吗？我前两天给你发消息打电话打也打不通！还以为你真的出事了！你手机拿来干什么去了！","confidence":0.984979,"sample_times":[412.0,416.0],"reconstruction":"temporal_consensus","source":"hard_subtitle_ocr","alternatives":["这能怪我们吗？我前两天给你发消息打电话打也打不通！还以为你真"]}
{"segment_id":86,"start":420.0,"end":424.0,"text":"这样一","confidence":0.99681,"sample_times":[420.0],"reconstruction":"direct_ocr","source":"hard_subtitle_ocr","alternatives":[]}
{"segment_id":87,"start":424.0,"end":428.0,"text":"素世（回忆）a","confidence":0.923942,"sample_times":[424.0],"reconstruction":"direct_ocr","source":"hard_subtitle_ocr","alternatives":[]}
{"segment_id":88,"start":428.0,"end":432.0,"text":"看！许愿池！正好正好，我要许一个！","confidence":0.90072,"sample_times":[428.0],"reconstruction":"direct_ocr","source":"hard_subtitle_ocr","alternatives":[]}
{"segment_id":89,"start":432.0,"end":436.0,"text":"都多大的人了还信这个。","confidence":0.99993,"sample_times":[432.0],"reconstruction":"direct_ocr","source":"hard_subtitle_ocr","alternatives":[]}
{"segment_id":90,"start":436.0,"end":440.0,"text":"刚骗完教导主任的人不准说这话，我要投币，今天运气太好了！","confidence":0.99516,"sample_times":[436.0],"reconstruction":"direct_ocr","source":"hard_subtitle_ocr","alternatives":[]}
{"segment_id":91,"start":440.0,"end":444.0,"text":"爱音掏出一枚硬币，站在池子边上念念有词。素世站在不远处看戏。","confidence":0.99974,"sample_times":[440.0],"reconstruction":"direct_ocr","source":"hard_subtitle_ocr","alternatives":[]}
{"segment_id":92,"start":444.0,"end":448.0,"text":"她深吸一口气，用一个夸张的抛掷动作把硬币扔向池中央。结果硬币顺着喷泉的柱子反弹了回来。","confidence":0.999508,"sample_times":[444.0],"reconstruction":"direct_ocr","source":"hard_subtitle_ocr","alternatives":[]}
{"segment_id":93,"start":448.0,"end":452.0,"text":"你这是什么扔法？投石问路吗？","confidence":0.98331,"sample_times":[448.0],"reconstruction":"direct_ocr","source":"hard_subtitle_ocr","alternatives":[]}
{"segment_id":94,"start":452.0,"end":456.0,"text":"不行不行！刚才的不算，等我捡回来重扔，许愿币不进水不灵的。","confidence":0.99691,"sample_times":[452.0],"reconstruction":"direct_ocr","source":"hard_subtitle_ocr","alternatives":[]}
{"segment_id":95,"start":456.0,"end":460.0,"text":"这叫做许愿池的拒绝吧","confidence":0.9999,"sample_times":[456.0],"reconstruction":"direct_ocr","source":"hard_subtitle_ocr","alternatives":[]}
{"segment_id":96,"start":460.0,"end":464.0,"text":"素世拗不过爱音，只好让她接着去捡。一手","confidence":0.958884,"sample_times":[460.0],"reconstruction":"direct_ocr","source":"hard_subtitle_ocr","alternatives":[]}
{"segment_id":97,"start":464.0,"end":468.0,"text":"爱音的手指够了几次没够到，往前又挪了半步","confidence":0.99812,"sample_times":[464.0],"reconstruction":"direct_ocr","source":"hard_subtitle_ocr","alternatives":[]}
{"segment_id":98,"start":472.0,"end":476.0,"text":"小爱音！！！","confidence":0.98036,"sample_times":[472.0],"reconstruction":"direct_ocr","source":"hard_subtitle_ocr","alternatives":[]}
{"segment_id":99,"start":476.0,"end":480.0,"text":"哎呦……我……我没事……","confidence":0.9911,"sample_times":[476.0],"reconstruction":"direct_ocr","source":"hard_subtitle_ocr","alternatives":[]}
{"segment_id":100,"start":480.0,"end":484.0,"text":"爱音本人的确没事，可爱音放在边上的手机就在刚刚被她一巴掌拍飞。手机的抛物线比硬币更加精准地落进水池里。","confidence":0.999703,"sample_times":[480.0],"reconstruction":"direct_ocr","source":"hard_subtitle_ocr","alternatives":[]}
{"segment_id":101,"start":484.0,"end":488.0,"text":"哈哈哈哈","confidence":0.99986,"sample_times":[484.0],"reconstruction":"direct_ocr","source":"hard_subtitle_ocr","alternatives":[]}
{"segment_id":102,"start":488.0,"end":492.0,"text":"好了不要笑啦，快点帮我来捞呀！","confidence":0.99746,"sample_times":[488.0],"reconstruction":"direct_ocr","source":"hard_subtitle_ocr","alternatives":[]}
{"segment_id":103,"start":492.0,"end":496.0,"text":"素世趴在池沿上往水里看。水不算深，能清晰看到爱音的手机躺在两枚硬币","confidence":0.99837,"sample_times":[492.0],"reconstruction":"direct_ocr","source":"hard_subtitle_ocr","alternatives":[]}
{"segment_id":104,"start":496.0,"end":500.0,"text":"在尚且还没有熄灭的屏幕上发来爱音妈的一条消息：","confidence":0.97755,"sample_times":[496.0],"reconstruction":"direct_ocr","source":"hard_subtitle_ocr","alternatives":[]}
{"segment_id":105,"start":504.0,"end":508.0,"text":"素世盯着那条消息拼尽全力绷住。她在后面拽着爱音，让她捞手机的同时不去掉进水里。","confidence":0.998757,"sample_times":[504.0],"reconstruction":"direct_ocr","source":"hard_subtitle_ocr","alternatives":[]}
{"segment_id":106,"start":508.0,"end":512.0,"text":"素世世，你看到我的手机了吗？","confidence":0.99176,"sample_times":[508.0],"reconstruction":"direct_ocr","source":"hard_subtitle_ocr","alternatives":[]}
{"segment_id":107,"start":512.0,"end":516.0,"text":"什么？在哪边？","confidence":0.99625,"sample_times":[512.0],"reconstruction":"direct_ocr","source":"hard_subtitle_ocr","alternatives":[]}
{"segment_id":108,"start":516.0,"end":520.0,"text":"就在那边！你右手边！","confidence":0.99197,"sample_times":[516.0],"reconstruction":"direct_ocr","source":"hard_subtitle_ocr","alternatives":[]}
{"segment_id":109,"start":524.0,"end":532.0,"text":"素世往后拽了一下，爱音的另一只手撑在池沿上借力。但两人都忘了刚刚这个地方就是爱音滑倒的地方。","confidence":0.999725,"sample_times":[524.0,528.0],"reconstruction":"temporal_consensus","source":"hard_subtitle_ocr","alternatives":["素世往后拽了一下，爱音的另一只手撑在池沿上借力。但两人都忘了刚刚这个地方就是爱音滑倒的地"]}
{"segment_id":110,"start":532.0,"end":536.0,"text":"于是，另一部手机以一道和刚才爱音的手机几乎一模一样的抛物线，精准地落入水中。","confidence":0.9998,"sample_times":[532.0],"reconstruction":"direct_ocr","source":"hard_subtitle_ocr","alternatives":[]}
{"segment_id":111,"start":536.0,"end":540.0,"text":"000000","confidence":0.91344,"sample_times":[536.0],"reconstruction":"direct_ocr","source":"hard_subtitle_ocr","alternatives":[]}
{"segment_id":112,"start":540.0,"end":548.0,"text":"也就是说，你们俩的手机在这之后都报废了。","confidence":0.999255,"sample_times":[540.0,544.0],"reconstruction":"temporal_consensus","source":"hard_subtitle_ocr","alternatives":["也就是说，你们"]}
{"segment_id":113,"start":548.0,"end":552.0,"text":"现在一起在素世家的米缸里躺着呢。","confidence":0.99943,"sample_times":[548.0],"reconstruction":"direct_ocr","source":"hard_subtitle_ocr","alternatives":[]}
{"segment_id":114,"start":552.0,"end":556.0,"text":"那你这周一干嘛去了？要是周一回学校传言还不至于变成现在这样。","confidence":0.99335,"sample_times":[552.0],"reconstruction":"direct_ocr","source":"hard_subtitle_ocr","alternatives":[]}
{"segment_id":115,"start":556.0,"end":560.0,"text":"这个……我不是生病了嘛……所以就和素世世在她家里多待了一天？","confidence":0.985867,"sample_times":[556.0],"reconstruction":"direct_ocr","source":"hard_subtitle_ocr","alternatives":[]}
{"segment_id":116,"start":560.0,"end":564.0,"text":"最后一个问题。","confidence":0.99998,"sample_times":[560.0],"reconstruction":"direct_ocr","source":"hard_subtitle_ocr","alternatives":[]}
{"segment_id":117,"start":564.0,"end":568.0,"text":"请讲?","confidence":0.91692,"sample_times":[564.0],"reconstruction":"direct_ocr","source":"hard_subtitle_ocr","alternatives":[]}
{"segment_id":118,"start":568.0,"end":572.0,"text":"有没有很","confidence":0.99949,"sample_times":[568.0],"reconstruction":"direct_ocr","source":"hard_subtitle_ocr","alternatives":[]}
{"segment_id":119,"start":572.0,"end":576.0,"text":"像你个鬼啊！！","confidence":0.99128,"sample_times":[572.0],"reconstruction":"direct_ocr","source":"hard_subtitle_ocr","alternatives":[]}
{"segment_id":120,"start":576.0,"end":580.0,"text":"我……我知道错了……","confidence":0.99422,"sample_times":[576.0],"reconstruction":"direct_ocr","source":"hard_subtitle_ocr","alternatives":[]}
{"segment_id":121,"start":580.0,"end":584.0,"text":"太好了爱音，你还活着！","confidence":0.95272,"sample_times":[580.0],"reconstruction":"direct_ocr","source":"hard_subtitle_ocr","alternatives":[]}
{"segment_id":122,"start":584.0,"end":588.0,"text":"灯灯别担心，我一直都好好的。那啥……各位…","confidence":0.992163,"sample_times":[584.0],"reconstruction":"direct_ocr","source":"hard_subtitle_ocr","alternatives":[]}
{"segment_id":123,"start":588.0,"end":592.0,"text":"把灯抱在怀里，爱音随即说出了全羽丘建校以来最有魄力的一句话一","confidence":0.99718,"sample_times":[588.0],"reconstruction":"direct_ocr","source":"hard_subtitle_ocr","alternatives":[]}
{"segment_id":124,"start":592.0,"end":596.0,"text":"这个…要不咱先说说这个追悼会的账找谁报销？","confidence":0.983385,"sample_times":[592.0],"reconstruction":"direct_ocr","source":"hard_subtitle_ocr","alternatives":[]}
